                 ‹  1  2  3  ›     vai a [  ]", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 526447239, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 266848950, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a0157", "type": "text", "id": "e157", "x": 2440, "y": 700, "width": 479.05, "height": 32.5, "text": "Vista, pagina e quanti per pagina stanno nell'URL come in /backlog.\nL'ordinamento è quello salvato e qui non si cambia.", "originalText": "Vista, pagina e quanti per pagina stanno nell'URL come in /backlog.\nL'ordinamento è quello salvato e qui non si cambia.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 382708173, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 190359524, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a0158", "type": "text", "id": "e158", "x": 2400, "y": 810, "width": 118.80000000000001, "height": 22.5, "text": "3b · elimina", "originalText": "3b · elimina", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 16702